  "limits": [
    "This release completes local inventory workflows. It does not enroll a real agent or MDM provider, infer online/compliance status or execute remote device commands.",
    "No personal production login, MFA enrollment, eligibility grant or activation was performed; interactive browser tests use synthetic local fixtures and the actual OAuth integration test uses a disposable environment.",
    "The existing five-minute MFA freshness rule remains independent of the PIM lease duration.",
    "CSV is limited to 5000 filtered devices and the web client accepts downloads up to 32 MiB. Large exports require narrower filters.",
    "Audit events are retained locally with pending outbox state; external delivery is not claimed.",
    "Migration 007 retains all business rows and replaces guarded functions. After new lifecycle states/events exist, keep a protocol-2-compatible device receiver when rolling back applications; do not automatically downgrade it or restore the database."
